{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"本杰明·富兰克林·生平与时代","stage":"DONE","category":"benjamin-franklin","categoryLabel":"本杰明·富兰克林","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/05_benjamin-franklin/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"生平与时代\">生平与时代</h1><p>本卷按时间顺序讲述本杰明·富兰克林（1706年1月17日—1790年4月17日）的一生：从波士顿一个制烛匠之子，到费城首屈一指的印刷商，再到美国的开国元勋。他仅受过约两年正规教育，却凭自学与勤勉跨越科学、政治、外交、公益诸多领域，成为&quot;白手起家&quot;美国精神最字面、最生动的化身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷讲什么-不讲什么-vs-兄弟卷\">本卷讲什么、不讲什么（vs 兄弟卷）</h2><p>本卷只回答一个问题：<strong>富兰克林的一生，按时间顺序发生了什么？</strong> 它提供贯穿全人物 hub 的&quot;时间骨架&quot;。具体的事功、思想与评价，留给同一人物下的其他兄弟卷，避免重复展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你想了解</th>\n<th>请前往</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一生大事的时间线（本卷）</td>\n<td>生平与时代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电学、避雷针、自我修养系统、建国制度等具体成果</td>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实用主义、自我修养、启蒙价值等思想方法</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>《自传》《穷理查年鉴》等代表作文本</td>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国原型、对成功学的影响、不朽遗产</td>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蓄奴矛盾、形象争议、整体评价</td>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>凡涉及&quot;为什么重要&quot;&quot;如何评价&quot;的深层议题，本卷只点到并交叉链接，不与上述兄弟卷重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三章结构与推荐学习路径\">三章结构与推荐学习路径</h2><p>本卷分三章、六篇，建议按时间顺序通读：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph C1[&quot;第一章 波士顿与学徒岁月&quot;]&#10;        A1[&quot;寒微的出身&lt;br/&gt;1706-1718&quot;] --&gt; A2[&quot;印刷学徒&lt;br/&gt;1718-1723&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph C2[&quot;第二章 费城的崛起&quot;]&#10;        B1[&quot;白手起家的印刷商&lt;br/&gt;1723-1748&quot;] --&gt; B2[&quot;公共事业的领袖&lt;br/&gt;1727-1751&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph C3[&quot;第三章 政治家与晚年&quot;]&#10;        D1[&quot;美国国父&lt;br/&gt;1754-1787&quot;] --&gt; D2[&quot;晚年与辞世&lt;br/&gt;1785-1790&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    C1 --&gt; C2 --&gt; C3\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph C1[\"第一章 波士顿与学徒岁月\"]\n        A1[\"寒微的出身&lt;br/&gt;1706-1718\"] --&gt; A2[\"印刷学徒&lt;br/&gt;1718-1723\"]\n    end\n    subgraph C2[\"第二章 费城的崛起\"]\n        B1[\"白手起家的印刷商&lt;br/&gt;1723-1748\"] --&gt; B2[\"公共事业的领袖&lt;br/&gt;1727-1751\"]\n    end\n    subgraph C3[\"第三章 政治家与晚年\"]\n        D1[\"美国国父&lt;br/&gt;1754-1787\"] --&gt; D2[\"晚年与辞世&lt;br/&gt;1785-1790\"]\n    end\n    C1 --&gt; C2 --&gt; C3</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章·波士顿与学徒岁月</strong>：<a href=\"boston-and-apprenticeship/humble-origins\">寒微的出身</a> → <a href=\"boston-and-apprenticeship/printer-apprentice\">印刷学徒</a>。讲他的家庭、辍学、少年自学，以及学徒期的写作训练与1723年出走。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章·费城的崛起</strong>：<a href=\"philadelphia-rise/self-made-printer\">白手起家的印刷商</a> → <a href=\"philadelphia-rise/civic-leader\">公共事业的领袖</a>。讲他如何建起印刷帝国、42岁财务自由，并把费城改造成有图书馆、消防队、医院与大学的城市。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章·政治家与晚年</strong>：<a href=\"statesman-and-final-years/founding-father\">美国国父</a> → <a href=\"statesman-and-final-years/final-years\">晚年与辞世</a>。讲他参与起草《独立宣言》、出使法国、参与制宪，以及晚年废奴与1790年辞世。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置与延伸\">前置与延伸</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置知识</strong>：本卷无硬性前置，适合作为整个富兰克林 hub 的入口。略备18世纪英属北美殖民地与美国独立战争的背景，会读得更顺。</li>\n<li><strong>读完之后</strong>：建议接续<a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>（把生平事件落成具体成果），再读<a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>（用批判视角重审本卷的英雄叙事）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>透过这条时间线，读者将看到一个真实而复杂的富兰克林——既是自学奇才与公益巨人，也是精明的形象营销者，理解他的起点，才能理解他何以成为美国精神最初的象征。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"boston-and-apprenticeship","title":"波士顿与学徒岁月","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/life-and-times/boston-and-apprenticeship","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"humble-origins","title":"寒微的出身","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/life-and-times/boston-and-apprenticeship/humble-origins"},{"seq":2,"slug":"printer-apprentice","title":"印刷学徒","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/life-and-times/boston-and-apprenticeship/printer-apprentice"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"philadelphia-rise","title":"费城的崛起","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/life-and-times/philadelphia-rise","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"self-made-printer","title":"白手起家的印刷商","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/life-and-times/philadelphia-rise/self-made-printer"},{"seq":2,"slug":"civic-leader","title":"公共事业的领袖","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/life-and-times/philadelphia-rise/civic-leader"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"statesman-and-final-years","title":"政治家与晚年","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/life-and-times/statesman-and-final-years","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"founding-father","title":"美国国父","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/life-and-times/statesman-and-final-years/founding-father"},{"seq":2,"slug":"final-years","title":"晚年与辞世","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/life-and-times/statesman-and-final-years/final-years"}]}]}